{{also|myanmar}}
==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|my|မြန်မာ}}, the formal Burmese name of the main ethnic group in Myanmar; {{m|my|ဗမာ}}, from which {{doublet|en|Burma|notext=1}} is derived, is the informal name. Both Burmese terms are also adjectives meaning "Burmese" (related to Myanmar/Burma, its, people, language, etc). When certain words are attached, the combination may mean specifically Myanmar (Burma) (country) or Burmese (person, language, etc.) - a noun.

===Pronunciation===
